{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vibe Clicker - Supporter Pack: Retro Tech Meets AI Future</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support indie game development while expanding your AI automation empire! This DLC bundle adds cosmetics with nostalgic tech vibes and other fun combinations to enhance your clicking journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's Inside:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetic Clickers:</strong> New Coffee Cup with your name on it, Boba Tea, CRT Monitor, Fidget Spinner, Big Red Button, and a futuristic laptop!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vintage Auto Clickers:</strong> Let classic tech handle the repetitive work: Dial-Up Modem, Classic Mouse, Cassette Tape, and a Rotary Phone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic Autobuy Bots:</strong> Automated purchasing with a retro twist: Mystic Ball (yes, it really works), Rudy Cube, GameGoob, and a 90s Pager.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Wallpapers: </strong>7 Additional wallpapers to customize your experience,\u00a0including a unique Noir-filter wallpaper, and an instant classic light-mode wallpaper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Cursors:</strong> 4 Additional cursors to make your clicking experience even cooler.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets:</strong> Unlock secret visuals by combining various cosmetics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why This DLC?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Supporter Pack directly funds my continued development of Vibe Clicker and future indie projects. You're not just getting new content, you're investing in my indie game development and helping me bring more unique experiences to life. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044800?t=1761915166","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic